<title>NETHERLANDS: DOCdata H1 97 profit up 60 pct.</title>
<headline>DOCdata H1 97 profit up 60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997 results</p>
<p>(in million of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit per share (guilders)	0.72  vs   0.54</p>
<p>    Net profit				   4.3   vs   2.7</p>
<p>    Turnover				    62.8   vs  52.5</p>
<p>Note - Dutch compact disc maker DOCdata has been listed on Amsterdam and NASDAQ exchanges since last May.</p>
